  "ingredients": [
    "8 potatoes, peeled and cubed",
    "4 cups chicken broth",
    "1 pound bacon, cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "3 leeks, sliced",
    "1 cup heavy cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6KyENqRttiglZFTU17BQGCQjnDM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22927-creamy-potato-leek-soup-ii-DDMFS-KH-ingredients-b77c83a37db847e08a1216aad0005d99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22927/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes and chicken broth in a large saucepan or stockpot; bring to a boil. Cook until potatoes are tender.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/39hLHJ3F1rRhXRchaRK7uVs9lXE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22927-creamy-potato-leek-soup-ii-DDMFS-KH-step2-bd00ccc3fb2d4f09a720dec65cf23956.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22927/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook bacon in a large, deep skillet over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned. Drain on paper towels. Reserve 3 tablespoons drippings in skillet; discard remaining drippings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ncoi_yj6_l0IhDDx864I7EkLq2s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22927-creamy-potato-leek-soup-ii-DDMFS-KH-step3-9d6b477ea2fa4d6ea8e2ef42c3cd0253.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22927/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add leeks to skillet over medium-high heat; sauté 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6KyENqRttiglZFTU17BQGCQjnDM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22927-creamy-potato-leek-soup-ii-DDMFS-KH-ingredients-b77c83a37db847e08a1216aad0005d99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22927/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When potatoes are tender, stir in heavy cream, bacon, and leeks until combined. Remove from heat. Serve hot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0OkZzEWk_Qlct7AG5CIBl46D58Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22927-creamy-potato-leek-soup-ii-DDMFS-KH-step5-b18cb480899c493c9c027f246a64c448.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22927/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dPDegGLnq6zRnDnoQSWOPytgtuc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22927-creamy-potato-leek-soup-ii-DDMFS-KH-4x3-e2ca0d61d643451ebc9397ee340954c1.jpg"
